const labels={accueil:'Vue d’ensemble',equipe:'Collaborateurs',conges:'Congés & absences',temps:'Temps de travail',recrutement:'Recrutement',talents:'Talents & formations',documents:'Documents RH',entretiens:'Entretiens',taches:'Tâches & notifications',parametres:'Paramètres'};
const icons={accueil:'⌂',equipe:'♙',conges:'◷',temps:'◴',recrutement:'✳',talents:'◇',documents:'▤',entretiens:'☷',taches:'✓',parametres:'⚙'};
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),state={user:null,page:'accueil',organization:'Chromatotec',summary:{},employees:[],leaves:[],attendance:[],jobs:[],candidates:[],courses:[],enrollments:[],documents:[],reviews:[],tasks:[],notifications:[],accounts:[],settings:[],policies:[],holidays:[],audit:[],profileChanges:[],attendanceCorrections:[],attendancePeriod:null,retention:{documents:[],candidates:[]}};let toastTimer;
const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
async function api(action,data){const headers={};if(data)headers['Content-Type']='application/json';if(window.NORIA_CONFIG?.apiKey)headers.apikey=window.NORIA_CONFIG.apiKey;const endpoint=window.NORIA_CONFIG?.endpoint||'/api';const [actionName,query='']=action.split('?'),params=new URLSearchParams({action:actionName});new URLSearchParams(query).forEach((v,k)=>params.set(k,v));const r=await fetch(endpoint+'?'+params,{method:data?'POST':'GET',headers,body:data?JSON.stringify(data):undefined,credentials:'same-origin'});const result=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Réponse invalide du serveur.'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(result.error||'Une erreur est survenue.');return result}
function toast(s){const el=$('#toast');el.textContent=s;el.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),3300)}
function date(v){return v?new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).format(new Date(v+'T12:00:00')):'—'}
function time(v){return v?new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}).format(new Date(v)):'—'}
function initials(a,b){return ((a||'')[0]||'')+((b||'')[0]||'')}
function canManage(){return ['admin','manager'].includes(state.user?.role)}
function admin(){return state.user?.role==='admin'}
function heading(title,desc,action=''){return `<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${desc}</p></div><div class="heading-actions">${action}</div></div>`}
function button(label,action,secondary=false){return `<button class="${secondary?'secondary-button':'primary-small'}" data-action="${action}">${label}</button>`}
function panel(title,sub,content,extra=''){return `<section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>${title}</h2>${sub?`<p>${sub}</p>`:''}</div>${extra}</div>${content}</section>`}
function stat(label,value,foot,icon,color){return `<article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-label">${label}</span><span class="stat-icon ${color}">${icon}</span></div><div class="stat-value">${value??'—'}</div><div class="stat-foot">${foot}</div></article>`}
function empty(icon,title,copy){return `<div class="empty-panel"><div class="empty-icon">${icon}</div><h3>${title}</h3><p>${copy}</p></div>`}
function pill(text,kind=''){return `<span class="status-pill ${kind}">${text}</span>`}
function toolbar(search='Rechercher…'){return `<div class="table-toolbar"><input class="search-box" data-search placeholder="⌕  ${search}"><select class="filter-select" data-status-filter><option value="">Tous les statuts</option><option value="pending">En attente</option><option value="approved">Validé</option><option value="rejected">Refusé</option><option value="open">Ouvert</option><option value="closed">Clôturé</option><option value="completed">Terminé</option></select></div>`}
function table(headers,rows){return `<div class="table-scroll"><table class="generic-table"><thead><tr>${headers.map(x=>`<th>${x}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows||''}</tbody></table></div>`}
function person(e){return `<div class="employee-cell"><span class="person-avatar">${esc(initials(e.first_name,e.last_name))}</span><span>${esc(`${e.first_name||''} ${e.last_name||''}`.trim()||e.identifier||'—')}</span></div>`}
function exportButton(kind){return `<button class="secondary-button" data-export="${kind}">Exporter CSV</button>`}
async function downloadCsv(kind){const mapping={employees:[state.employees,['staff_number','first_name','last_name','job_title','department','contract_type','start_date','end_date','location','phone_number','work_percentage','status','leave_balance']],leaves:[state.leaves,['first_name','last_name','leave_type','start_date','end_date','days','status','note']],attendance:[state.attendance,['first_name','last_name','work_date','clock_in','clock_out','work_minutes','note']],recruitment:[state.candidates,['first_name','last_name','job_title','stage','source','applied_at']],documents:[state.documents,['first_name','last_name','title','document_type','uploaded_at','retention_until']],reviews:[state.reviews,['first_name','last_name','review_type','scheduled_at','status','summary']]};const [rows,fields]=mapping[kind]||[[],[]],quote=v=>{let x=String(v??'');if(/^[=+@-]/.test(x))x="'"+x;return `"${x.replace(/"/g,'""')}"`},csv=[fields.map(quote).join(';'),...rows.map(row=>fields.map(k=>quote(row[k])).join(';'))].join('\r\n');try{await api('export-record',{kind,row_count:rows.length,period:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)})}catch(err){toast(err.message);return}const blob=new Blob(['\ufeff',csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=`noria-${kind}-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.csv`;a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}
function overview(){const s=state.summary||{},today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10),people=state.employees||[];const counts={active:people.filter(x=>x.status==='active').length,arrivals:people.filter(x=>x.start_date>=today).length};return `${heading(`Bonjour ${esc(state.user.first_name||'')}`,`Votre espace RH · ${new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long'}).format(new Date())}`,admin()?button('＋ Ajouter un collaborateur','add-employee'):'')}
<div class="stats-grid">${stat('Collaborateurs',s.employee_count??counts.active,'Effectif actif','♙','violet')}${stat('Absents aujourd’hui',s.on_leave_today??0,'Congés validés','◷','green')}${stat('À traiter',s.pending_leave??0,'Demandes en attente','◴','orange')}${stat('Postes ouverts',s.open_positions??0,'Recrutement','✳','pink')}</div>
<div class="content-grid">${panel('Prochaines absences','Planning partagé',state.leaves.filter(l=>l.status==='approved'&&l.end_date>=today).slice(0,5).map(l=>`<div class="absence-row">${person(l)}<span class="absence-date">${date(l.start_date)} – ${date(l.end_date)}</span></div>`).join('')||empty('◷','Aucune absence à venir','Les absences validées apparaîtront ici.'),`<button class="text-link" data-page="conges">Planning →</button>`)}${panel('Mes raccourcis','Les actions utiles',`<div class="quick-actions"><button data-page="conges">＋ Demander une absence</button><button data-page="temps">◴ Pointer mes horaires</button><button data-page="documents">▤ Consulter mes documents</button><button data-page="entretiens">☷ Voir mes entretiens</button></div>`)}</div>
${panel('À ne pas manquer','Votre activité RH',`<div class="notice-list"><article class="notice-card"><span class="notice-icon">♙</span><div><strong>Bienvenue dans Noria</strong><p>Votre dossier et vos démarches RH réunis au même endroit.</p></div></article><article class="notice-card"><span class="notice-icon green">◇</span><div><strong>Développement professionnel</strong><p>Découvrez les formations et suivez votre progression.</p></div></article><article class="notice-card"><span class="notice-icon orange">☷</span><div><strong>Entretiens</strong><p>Préparez vos objectifs et vos prochains échanges.</p></div></article></div>`)}`}
function employeePage(){const rows=state.employees.map(e=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${esc(e.status)}"><td>${person(e)}</td><td>${esc(e.job_title||'—')}</td><td>${esc(e.department||'—')}</td><td>${esc(e.contract_type||'—')}</td><td>${date(e.start_date)}</td><td>${Math.round(Number(e.work_percentage||100))}%</td><td>${pill(e.status==='active'?'Actif':e.status==='onboarding'?'Arrivée':'Inactif',e.status==='active'?'':'info')}</td>${admin()?`<td><button class="inline-action" data-edit-employee="${e.id}">Modifier</button><button class="inline-action" data-employee-history="${e.id}">Historique</button><button class="inline-action" data-employee-balance="${e.id}">Solde</button></td>`:''}</tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Collaborateurs','Dossiers, postes, équipes et mouvements RH.',admin()?`${button('＋ Nouveau dossier','add-employee')}${exportButton('employees')}`:exportButton('employees'))}${panel('Annuaire collaborateurs',`${state.employees.length} profils visibles dans votre périmètre`,`${toolbar('Nom, poste, service…')}${table(['COLLABORATEUR','POSTE','SERVICE','CONTRAT','ARRIVÉE','TAUX','STATUT',...(admin()?['ACTIONS']:[])],rows||`<tr><td colspan="8">${empty('♙','Aucun profil','Aucun collaborateur n’est visible dans votre périmètre.')}</td></tr>`)}`)}`}
function leavePage(){const rows=state.leaves.map(l=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${l.status}"><td>${person(l)}</td><td>${esc(l.leave_type)}</td><td>${date(l.start_date)}</td><td>${date(l.end_date)}</td><td>${l.days}</td><td>${pill(({pending:'À valider',approved:'Validée',rejected:'Refusée',cancelled:'Annulée'})[l.status]||l.status,l.status==='pending'?'pending':l.status==='approved'?'':'info')}</td><td>${canManage()&&l.status==='pending'?`<button class="inline-action" data-leave="${l.id}" data-decision="approved">Valider</button><button class="inline-action danger" data-leave="${l.id}" data-decision="rejected">Refuser</button>`:l.status==='pending'&&l.employee_id===state.user.employee_id?`<button class="inline-action danger" data-cancel-leave="${l.id}">Annuler</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Congés & absences','Demandes, soldes, règles configurées et calendrier des absences.',`${button('＋ Nouvelle demande','new-leave')}${exportButton('leaves')}`)}<div class="stats-grid">${stat('Mon solde',state.summary.leave_balance??0,'Solde disponible','◷','violet')}${stat('Mes demandes',state.summary.my_pending??0,'En attente','◴','orange')}${stat('Validées',state.summary.my_approved??0,'Historique','✓','green')}${stat('Équipe absente',state.summary.on_leave_today??0,'Aujourd’hui','♙','pink')}</div>${panel('Demandes d’absence','Historique et décisions',`${toolbar('Collaborateur ou type…')}${table(['COLLABORATEUR','TYPE','DU','AU','JOURS','STATUT','DÉCISION'],rows||`<tr><td colspan="7">${empty('◷','Aucune demande','Les demandes d’absence seront affichées ici.')}</td></tr>`)}`)}`}
function timePage(){const rows=state.attendance.map(a=>`<tr data-search-row><td>${person(a)}</td><td>${date(a.work_date)}</td><td>${time(a.clock_in)}</td><td>${time(a.clock_out)}</td><td>${a.work_minutes?`${Math.floor(a.work_minutes/60)} h ${String(a.work_minutes%60).padStart(2,'0')}`:'En cours'}</td><td>${(a.breaks||[]).filter(x=>x.start&&x.end).length}</td><td>${esc(a.note||'—')}</td><td>${a.employee_id===state.user.employee_id&&a.clock_in?`<button class="inline-action" data-correct-time="${a.id}">Demander une correction</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join(''),today=state.attendance.find(x=>x.employee_id===state.user.employee_id&&x.work_date===new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Europe/Paris'}).format(new Date())),activeBreak=(today?.breaks||[]).some(x=>x.start&&!x.end),punch=!today?.clock_in?button('▶ Commencer ma journée','clock-in'):today.clock_out?button('↻ Actualiser','refresh'):activeBreak?button('▶ Reprendre le travail','break-end'):button('Ⅱ Commencer une pause','break-start')+button('■ Terminer ma journée','clock-out',true),month=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Europe/Paris',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit'}).format(new Date()),closed=state.attendancePeriod?.status==='closed',requests=state.attendanceCorrections.map(r=>`<tr><td>${person(r)}</td><td>${date(r.created_at?.slice(0,10))}</td><td>${esc(r.reason)}</td><td>${pill(({pending:'À examiner',approved:'Validée',rejected:'Refusée'})[r.status]||r.status,r.status==='pending'?'pending':'info')}</td><td>${canManage()&&r.status==='pending'?`<button class="inline-action" data-time-decision="${r.id}" data-decision="approved">Valider</button><button class="inline-action danger" data-time-decision="${r.id}" data-decision="rejected">Refuser</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Temps de travail','Pointage, pauses et demandes de correction.',`${punch}${exportButton('attendance')}${admin()?`<button class="secondary-button" data-period-status="${closed?'reopened':'closed'}" data-period-month="${month}">${closed?'Rouvrir':'Clôturer'} le mois</button>`:''}`)}${admin()?panel('Période mensuelle',`${month} · ${closed?'Clôturée':'Ouverte'}`,closed?'Les pointages de la période sont verrouillés.':'La période reste modifiable jusqu’à sa clôture.') :''}<div class="stats-grid">${stat('Aujourd’hui',today?.clock_in?time(today.clock_in):'Non pointé','Début de journée','◴','violet')}${stat('Fin de journée',today?.clock_out?time(today.clock_out):'—',today?.clock_out?'Pointage terminé':'En cours','◷','green')}${stat('Temps travaillé',today?.work_minutes?`${(today.work_minutes/60).toFixed(1)} h`:'—','Pauses exclues du total','⌚','orange')}${stat('Jours suivis',state.attendance.length,'Historique accessible','✓','pink')}</div>${panel('Historique des pointages','Les corrections sont soumises à validation; les originaux restent historisés.',table(['COLLABORATEUR','DATE','ARRIVÉE','DÉPART','DURÉE','PAUSES','NOTE','ACTION'],rows)||empty('◴','Aucun pointage','Les journées pointées apparaîtront ici.'))}${requests?panel('Corrections à examiner','Demandes historisées, l’original reste conservé.',table(['COLLABORATEUR','DEMANDÉ LE','MOTIF','STATUT','DÉCISION'],requests)):''}`}
function taskPage(){const notes=state.notifications.map(n=>`<article class="notice-card"><span class="notice-icon ${n.read_at?'':'green'}">${n.read_at?'♧':'●'}</span><div><strong>${esc(n.title)}</strong><p>${esc(n.body)} · ${date(n.created_at?.slice(0,10))}</p></div>${!n.read_at?`<button class="inline-action" data-notification-read="${n.id}">Lu</button>`:''}</article>`).join(''),rows=state.tasks.map(t=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${t.status}"><td>${person(t)}</td><td><strong>${esc(t.title)}</strong>${t.description?`<small class="subcell">${esc(t.description)}</small>`:''}</td><td>${esc(({pre_arrival:'Avant arrivée',arrival:'Arrivée',departure:'Départ'})[t.phase]||t.phase)}</td><td>${date(t.due_date)}</td><td>${pill(({todo:'À faire',in_progress:'En cours',done:'Terminée',cancelled:'Annulée'})[t.status]||t.status,t.status==='todo'?'pending':'info')}</td><td>${t.status!=='done'&&t.status!=='cancelled'&&(admin()||t.assigned_to===state.user.employee_id)?`<button class="inline-action" data-task-status="${t.id}" data-status="${t.status==='todo'?'in_progress':'done'}">${t.status==='todo'?'Commencer':'Terminer'}</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Tâches & notifications','Vos échéances RH, tâches d’arrivée/départ et décisions à suivre.',canManage()?button('＋ Créer une tâche','add-task'):'')}${panel('Notifications','Informations liées à vos démarches Noria',notes?`<div class="notice-list">${notes}</div>`:empty('♧','Tout est à jour','Vos notifications apparaîtront ici.'))}${panel('Tâches RH',`${state.tasks.length} tâche(s) dans votre périmètre`,`${toolbar('Collaborateur ou tâche…')}${table(['COLLABORATEUR','TÂCHE','ÉTAPE','ÉCHÉANCE','STATUT','ACTION'],rows||`<tr><td colspan="6">${empty('✓','Aucune tâche','Aucune tâche RH ne vous est attribuée.')}</td></tr>`)}`)}`}
function hiringPage(){const rows=state.candidates.map(c=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${c.stage}"><td>${person(c)}</td><td>${esc(c.job_title||'Candidature spontanée')}</td><td>${date(c.applied_at)}</td><td><select class="filter-select" data-stage="${c.id}">${['applied','screening','interview','offer','hired','declined'].map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===c.stage?'selected':''}>${({applied:'Reçue',screening:'Préqualification',interview:'Entretien',offer:'Offre',hired:'Embauché·e',declined:'Refusée'})[v]}</option>`).join('')}</select></td><td>${esc(c.source||'—')}</td></tr>`).join('');const jobs=state.jobs.map(j=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${j.status}"><td><strong>${esc(j.title)}</strong></td><td>${esc(j.department||'—')}</td><td>${esc(j.location||'—')}</td><td>${esc(j.contract_type||'—')}</td><td>${pill(({draft:'Brouillon',open:'Ouvert',paused:'Suspendu',closed:'Clôturé'})[j.status]||j.status,j.status==='open'?'':'info')}</td><td>${canManage()&&j.status!=='closed'?`<button class="inline-action" data-close-job="${j.id}">Clôturer</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Recrutement','Postes ouverts et suivi des candidatures.',admin()?`${button('＋ Publier un poste','add-job')}${button('＋ Ajouter une candidature','add-candidate',true)}${exportButton('recruitment')}`:exportButton('recruitment'))}<div class="content-grid">${panel('Offres d’emploi','Postes affectés à votre périmètre',table(['POSTE','SERVICE','LIEU','CONTRAT','STATUT','ACTION'],jobs)||empty('✳','Aucun poste','Les postes ouverts apparaîtront ici.'))}${panel('Candidatures','Étapes du processus',table(['CANDIDAT·E','POSTE','REÇUE LE','ÉTAPE','SOURCE'],rows)||empty('♙','Aucune candidature','Les candidatures reçues apparaîtront ici.'))}</div>`}
function talentsPage(){const rows=state.courses.map(c=>{const enrolled=state.enrollments.some(x=>x.training_id===c.id&&x.employee_id===state.user.employee_id);return `<tr data-search-row data-status="${c.status}"><td><strong>${esc(c.title)}</strong><small class="subcell">${esc(c.provider||'Formation interne')}</small></td><td>${date(c.starts_at)}${c.ends_at?` – ${date(c.ends_at)}`:''}</td><td>${c.seats??'—'}</td><td>${pill(({planned:'À venir',open:'Inscriptions ouvertes',in_progress:'En cours',completed:'Terminée',cancelled:'Annulée'})[c.status]||c.status,c.status==='open'?'':'info')}</td><td>${enrolled?pill(state.enrollments.find(x=>x.training_id===c.id&&x.employee_id===state.user.employee_id)?.status==='waitlisted'?'Liste d’attente':'Inscrit·e'):c.status==='open'?`<button class="inline-action" data-enroll="${c.id}">S’inscrire</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`}).join('');const enrollments=state.enrollments.map(x=>`<tr><td>${person(x)}</td><td>${esc(x.title||'Formation')}</td><td>${pill(x.status==='completed'?'Terminée':x.status==='cancelled'?'Annulée':'Inscrit·e',x.status==='completed'?'':'pending')}</td><td>${canManage()&&x.status==='registered'?`<button class="inline-action" data-training-complete="${x.id}">Marquer terminée</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Talents & formations','Catalogue, inscriptions et développement des compétences.',admin()?button('＋ Ajouter une formation','add-course'):'')}${panel('Catalogue de formation','Formations et inscriptions',table(['FORMATION','DATES','PLACES','STATUT','INSCRIPTION'],rows)||empty('◇','Catalogue à construire','Les formations proposées apparaîtront ici.'))}${enrollments?panel('Inscriptions','Suivi des participations',table(['COLLABORATEUR','FORMATION','STATUT','ACTION'],enrollments)):''}`}
function documentsPage(){const rows=state.documents.map(d=>`<tr data-search-row><td><strong>${esc(d.title)}</strong></td><td>${esc(d.document_type||'Document')}</td><td>${person(d)}</td><td>${date(d.uploaded_at?.slice(0,10))}</td><td>${date(d.retention_until)}</td><td>${d.url?`<a class="inline-action" href="${esc(d.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ouvrir ↗</a>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Documents RH','Documents personnels conservés dans un espace privé.',admin()?`${button('＋ Déposer un document','upload-document')}${exportButton('documents')}`:exportButton('documents'))}${panel('Mes documents','Liens privés à durée limitée; accès contrôlé par le rôle.',table(['DOCUMENT','TYPE','COLLABORATEUR','DÉPOSÉ LE','CONSERVER JUSQU’AU','FICHIER'],rows)||empty('▤','Aucun document','Les documents disponibles apparaîtront ici.'))}`}
function reviewsPage(){const rows=state.reviews.map(r=>`<tr data-search-row data-status="${r.status}"><td>${person(r)}</td><td>${esc(({annual:'Annuel',probation:'Fin de période d’essai',professional:'Entretien professionnel'})[r.review_type]||r.review_type)}</td><td>${date(r.scheduled_at)}</td><td>${pill(({planned:'À planifier',in_progress:'En cours',completed:'Terminé',cancelled:'Annulé'})[r.status]||r.status,r.status==='completed'?'':'pending')}</td><td>${esc(r.summary||'—')}</td><td>${canManage()&&r.status!=='completed'?`<button class="inline-action" data-review-update="${r.id}" data-status="${r.status==='planned'?'in_progress':'completed'}">${r.status==='planned'?'Commencer':'Terminer'}</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');return `${heading('Entretiens','Campagnes, rendez-vous et suivi des objectifs.',canManage()?`${button('＋ Planifier un entretien','add-review')}${exportButton('reviews')}`:exportButton('reviews'))}${panel('Entretiens planifiés','Les échanges visibles selon vos droits.',table(['COLLABORATEUR','TYPE','DATE','STATUT','SYNTHÈSE','ACTION'],rows)||empty('☷','Aucun entretien','Les entretiens planifiés apparaîtront ici.'))}`}
function settingsPage(){
 const organization=state.settings.find(x=>x.setting_key==='organization')?.setting_value||{},retention=state.settings.find(x=>x.setting_key==='retention')?.setting_value||{};
 const password=panel('Changer mon mot de passe','Mot de passe unique de 12 caracteres minimum.',`<form id="password-change" class="form-grid"><label class="span-2">${state.user.must_change_password?'Mot de passe provisoire':'Mot de passe actuel'}<input type="password" name="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" ${state.user.must_change_password?'':'required'}></label><label>Nouveau mot de passe<input type="password" name="new_password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><label>Confirmer<input type="password" name="confirm_password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><div class="span-2"><button class="primary-small">Mettre a jour</button></div></form>`);
 const profile=panel('Demander une correction de mon dossier','Les changements sont appliques apres validation.',`<form id="profile-change-form" class="form-grid"><label>Telephone<input name="phone_number" maxlength="160"></label><label>Lieu / site<input name="location" maxlength="160"></label><label class="span-2">Motif<input name="reason" maxlength="500"></label><div class="span-2"><button class="primary-small">Envoyer ma demande</button></div></form>`);
 const profileRows=state.profileChanges.map(r=>`<tr><td>${person(r)}</td><td>${esc(Object.entries(r.requested_changes||{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+v).join(' | '))}</td><td>${esc(r.reason||'—')}</td><td>${date(r.created_at?.slice(0,10))}</td><td>${canManage()?`<button class="inline-action" data-profile-decision="${r.id}" data-decision="approved">Approuver</button><button class="inline-action danger" data-profile-decision="${r.id}" data-decision="rejected">Refuser</button>`:pill('En attente','pending')}</td></tr>`).join('');
 let adminHtml='';
 if(admin()){
  adminHtml+=panel('Organisation','Nom et sites utilises pour les dossiers RH.','<form id="organization-settings-form" class="form-grid"><label>Nom de l’organisation<input name="name" required maxlength="100" value="'+esc(organization.name||state.organization)+'"></label><label>Sites (separes par des virgules)<input name="locations" value="'+esc((organization.locations||[]).join(', '))+'"></label><div><button class="primary-small">Enregistrer</button></div></form>');
  adminHtml+=panel('Durees de conservation','Echeances a valider selon les finalites RH.','<form id="retention-settings-form" class="form-grid"><label>Documents salaries<input type="number" min="1" max="3650" name="document_days" value="'+esc(retention.document_days||'')+'"></label><label>Candidatures<input type="number" min="1" max="3650" name="candidate_days" value="'+esc(retention.candidate_days||'')+'"></label><div class="span-2"><button class="primary-small">Enregistrer</button></div></form>');
  const accounts=state.accounts.map(a=>`<tr><td>${person(a)}</td><td>${esc(a.identifier)}</td><td>${esc(({admin:'RH',manager:'Manager',employee:'Collaborateur'})[a.role]||a.role)}</td><td>${pill(a.enabled?'Actif':'Desactive',a.enabled?'':'info')}</td><td>${a.must_change_password?pill('Mot de passe a renouveler','pending'):'—'}</td><td><button class="inline-action" data-account-edit="${a.employee_id}">Gerer</button></td></tr>`).join('');
  adminHtml+=panel('Comptes et habilitations','Roles, acces et renouvellement des mots de passe.',table(['COLLABORATEUR','IDENTIFIANT','ROLE','ACCES','SECURITE','ACTION'],accounts)||empty('♙','Aucun compte','Aucun compte disponible.'));
  const policies=state.policies.map(p=>`<tr><td>${esc(p.leave_type)}</td><td>${p.enabled?'Actif':'Inactif'}</td><td>${p.counts_weekends?'Calendaires':'Hors week-ends'}</td><td>${p.paid?'Oui':'Non'}</td><td>${p.annual_allowance??'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');
  adminHtml+=panel('Regles d’absence','Calcul et impact sur les soldes.','<form id="leave-policy-form" class="form-grid"><label>Type<input name="leave_type" required></label><label>Droit annuel indicatif<input type="number" name="annual_allowance" min="0" step="0.5"></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="counts_weekends"><span>Compter les week-ends</span></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="paid"><span>Deduit du solde</span></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" checked><span>Type actif</span></label><div><button class="primary-small">Enregistrer</button></div></form>'+table(['TYPE','ETAT','CALCUL','DEDUIT DU SOLDE','DROIT INDICATIF'],policies));
  const holidays=state.holidays.map(h=>`<tr><td>${date(h.holiday_date)}</td><td>${esc(h.label)}</td><td>${esc(h.location||'Tous les sites')}</td><td><button class="inline-action danger" data-holiday-delete="${h.id}">Supprimer</button></td></tr>`).join('');
  adminHtml+=panel('Jours feries et fermetures','Exclus du calcul selon le site.','<form id="holiday-form" class="form-grid"><label>Date<input name="holiday_date" type="date" required></label><label>Libelle<input name="label" required></label><label>Site<input name="location"></label><div><button class="primary-small">Ajouter</button></div></form>'+table(['DATE','LIBELLE','SITE','ACTION'],holidays));
  const expired=[...state.retention.documents.map(x=>({title:x.title,until:x.retention_until,type:'Document'})),...state.retention.candidates.map(x=>({title:x.first_name+' '+x.last_name,until:x.retention_until,type:'Candidature'}))].map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.title)}</td><td>${date(x.until)}</td><td>${esc(x.type)}</td></tr>`).join('');
  adminHtml+=panel('Conservation a examiner','Liste de suivi sans suppression automatique.',table(['ELEMENT','ECHEANCE','CATEGORIE'],expired));
  adminHtml+=panel('Journal des actions RH','Decisions et operations sensibles.',table(['DATE','ACTION','CIBLE','DETAILS'],state.audit.slice(0,40).map(x=>`<tr><td>${date(x.created_at?.slice(0,10))}</td><td>${esc(x.action)}</td><td>${esc(x.target_type)}</td><td>${esc(Object.keys(x.metadata||{}).join(', ')||'—')}</td></tr>`).join('')));
 }
 return heading('Parametres','Compte, corrections de profil et administration RH.')+password+profile+(profileRows?panel('Demandes de correction','Demandes recues',table(['COLLABORATEUR','CHANGEMENTS','MOTIF','DATE','DECISION'],profileRows)):'')+adminHtml+'<section class="panel privacy-note"><h2>Protection des donnees</h2><p>Connexion par identifiant professionnel, sans adresse e-mail. Les durees sont parametrees par finalite et restent sous controle RH.</p></section>';
}
function pageContent(){return ({accueil:overview,equipe:employeePage,conges:leavePage,temps:timePage,recrutement:hiringPage,talents:talentsPage,documents:documentsPage,entretiens:reviewsPage,taches:taskPage,parametres:settingsPage})[state.page]?.()||overview()}
function render(){if(!$('#page-content'))return;$('#breadcrumb').textContent=labels[state.page]||labels.accueil;$('#page-content').innerHTML=pageContent();document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item[data-page]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.page===state.page));$('.sidebar').classList.remove('open')}
function setUser(user){state.user=user;$('#login').classList.add('hidden');$('#app').classList.remove('hidden');const name=`${user.first_name||''} ${user.last_name||''}`.trim()||user.identifier;$('#profile-name').textContent=name;const workspaceName=$('#workspace-name');if(workspaceName)workspaceName.textContent=state.organization;$('#profile-role').textContent=({admin:'Administration RH',manager:'Manager',employee:'Collaborateur'})[user.role]||'Collaborateur';$('#profile-avatar').textContent=initials(user.first_name,user.last_name)||'RH';$('#top-avatar').textContent=initials(user.first_name,user.last_name)||'RH';document.querySelectorAll('#navigation [data-page="equipe"],#navigation [data-page="recrutement"]').forEach(n=>{n.hidden=!canManage()});state.page=user.must_change_password?'parametres':state.page;if(user.must_change_password)toast('Changez votre mot de passe provisoire pour continuer.');render()}
function resetLogin(){state.user=null;$('#app').classList.add('hidden');$('#login').classList.remove('hidden');$('#password').value='';$('#identifier').focus()}
async function refresh(){const d=await api('dashboard');Object.assign(state,{summary:d.summary||{},employees:d.employees||[],leaves:d.leaves||[],organization:d.organization||state.organization});if(state.page==='temps'){const calls=[api('attendance'),api('attendance-corrections'),...(admin()?[api('attendance-period')]:[])],results=await Promise.all(calls),[r,c,p]=results;state.attendance=r.records||[];state.attendanceCorrections=c.requests||[];state.attendancePeriod=p?.period||null}if(state.page==='recrutement'){const r=await api('recruitment');state.jobs=r.jobs||[];state.candidates=r.candidates||[]}if(state.page==='talents'){const r=await api('training');state.courses=r.courses||[];state.enrollments=r.enrollments||[]}if(state.page==='documents'){const r=await api('documents');state.documents=r.documents||[]}if(state.page==='entretiens'){const r=await api('reviews');state.reviews=r.reviews||[]}if(state.page==='taches'){const [t,n]=await Promise.all([api('tasks'),api('notifications')]);state.tasks=t.tasks||[];state.notifications=n.notifications||[]}if(state.page==='parametres'){const p=await api('profile-changes');state.profileChanges=p.requests||[];if(admin()){const [a,c,h,r,l]=await Promise.all([api('accounts'),api('settings'),api('audit'),api('retention-review'),api('employees')]);state.accounts=a.accounts||[];state.settings=c.settings||[];state.policies=c.policies||[];state.holidays=c.holidays||[];state.audit=h.events||[];state.retention={documents:r.documents||[],candidates:r.candidates||[]};state.employees=l.employees||state.employees}}render()}
function showModal(title,fields,submitLabel='Enregistrer'){const node=document.createElement('div');node.className='modal-backdrop';node.innerHTML=`<form class="modal-card" id="action-form"><button type="button" class="modal-close" aria-label="Fermer">×</button><div class="eyebrow">ESPACE RH</div><h2>${title}</h2><div class="form-grid">${fields}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-cancel>Annuler</button><button class="primary-small">${submitLabel}</button></div></form>`;document.body.append(node);node.querySelector('.modal-close').onclick=node.querySelector('[data-cancel]').onclick=()=>node.remove();return node}
function field(name,label,type='text',required=true,options=null,extra=''){if(options)return `<label>${label}<select name="${name}" ${required?'required':''}>${options.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x[0])}">${esc(x[1])}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`;return `<label>${label}<input name="${name}" type="${type}" ${required?'required':''} ${extra}></label>`}
function selectEmployees(name='employee_id'){return `<label>Collaborateur<select name="${name}" required>${state.employees.map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}">${esc(`${e.first_name} ${e.last_name}`)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`}
function openForm(action){let title='',fields='',data={};if(action==='add-task'){title='Créer une tâche d’arrivée ou de départ';fields=selectEmployees()+field('title','Tâche')+field('phase','Étape','text',true,[['pre_arrival','Avant arrivée'],['arrival','Arrivée'],['departure','Départ']])+`<label>Attribuée à<select name="assigned_to"><option value="">À définir</option>${state.employees.map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}">${esc(e.first_name+' '+e.last_name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`+field('due_date','Échéance','date',false)+`<label class="span-2">Détail<textarea name="description" rows="3"></textarea></label>`;}else if(action==='add-employee'){title='Créer un dossier collaborateur';fields=field('first_name','Prénom')+field('last_name','Nom')+field('staff_number','Matricule')+field('identifier','Identifiant de connexion')+field('password','Mot de passe temporaire','password',true,null,'minlength="12"')+field('role','Rôle','text',true,[['employee','Collaborateur'],['manager','Manager']])+`<label>Manager hiérarchique<select name="manager_id"><option value="">Aucun</option>${state.employees.map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}">${esc(e.first_name+' '+e.last_name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`+field('job_title','Intitulé du poste', 'text',false)+field('department','Service','text',false)+field('contract_type','Contrat','text',false)+field('start_date','Date d’arrivée','date',false)+field('location','Lieu','text',false)+field('work_percentage','Taux d’activité (%)','number',false,null,'min="1" max="100" step="0.01" value="100"')+field('leave_balance','Solde initial de congés','number',false,null,'min="0" step="0.5" value="0"');}
else if(action==='add-job'){title='Publier un poste';fields=field('title','Intitulé du poste')+field('department','Service','text',false)+field('location','Lieu','text',false)+field('contract_type','Type de contrat','text',false)+field('opened_at','Date de publication','date',false)+`<label>Manager recruteur<select name="hiring_manager_id"><option value="">Non attribué</option>${state.employees.filter(e=>e.role==='manager').map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}">${esc(e.first_name+' '+e.last_name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`+`<label class="span-2">Description<textarea name="description" rows="4"></textarea></label>`;}
else if(action==='add-candidate'){title='Ajouter une candidature';fields=field('first_name','Prénom')+field('last_name','Nom')+`<label>Poste visé<select name="job_posting_id"><option value="">Candidature spontanée</option>${state.jobs.filter(j=>j.status==='open').map(j=>`<option value="${j.id}">${esc(j.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`+field('source','Origine','text',false)+field('applied_at','Date de candidature','date',false)+field('retention_until','Date de fin de conservation','date',false)+`<label class="span-2 check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy_notice_confirmed" required><span>J’ai remis au candidat l’information relative à l’utilisation et à la conservation de ses données.</span></label>`+`<label class="span-2">Notes<textarea name="notes" rows="3"></textarea></label>`;}
else if(action==='add-course'){title='Créer une formation';fields=field('title','Intitulé')+field('provider','Organisme','text',false)+field('starts_at','Début','date',false)+field('ends_at','Fin','date',false)+field('seats','Nombre de places','number',false)+`<label class="span-2">Description<textarea name="description" rows="3"></textarea></label>`;}
else if(action==='add-review'){title='Planifier un entretien';fields=selectEmployees()+field('review_type','Type','text',true)+field('scheduled_at','Date','date',true)+field('status','État','text',true,[['planned','À planifier'],['in_progress','En cours']])+`<label class="span-2">Objectifs / notes<textarea name="summary" rows="3"></textarea></label>`;}
else if(action==='new-leave'){title='Demander une absence';fields=field('leave_type','Type','text',true,[['Congés payés','Congés payés'],['RTT','RTT'],['Maladie','Maladie'],['Sans solde','Sans solde'],['Autre','Autre']])+field('start_date','Premier jour','date')+field('end_date','Dernier jour','date')+`<label class="span-2">Commentaire facultatif<textarea name="note" rows="3"></textarea></label>`;}
else if(action==='upload-document'){title='Déposer un document RH';fields=selectEmployees()+field('title','Nom du document')+field('document_type','Type de document','text',true,[['contract','Contrat'],['payslip','Bulletin de paie'],['certificate','Attestation'],['identity','Identité'],['other','Autre']])+field('retention_until','Date de fin de conservation','date',false)+`<label class="span-2">Fichier privé<input name="file" type="file" required accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" data-file></label>`;}
const modal=showModal(title,fields);modal.querySelector('form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(e.target);let newCredential=null;try{if(action==='add-task'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('task-save',data)}else if(action==='add-employee'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);const created=await api('add-employee',data);newCredential={identifier:created.identifier,password:data.password}}else if(action==='add-job'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('job-save',data)}else if(action==='add-candidate'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('candidate-save',data)}else if(action==='add-course'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('training-save',data)}else if(action==='add-review'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('review-save',data)}else if(action==='new-leave'){data=Object.fromEntries(fd);await api('leave',data)}else if(action==='upload-document'){const file=fd.get('file');if(!file||file.size>5000000)throw Error('Choisissez un fichier de 5 Mo maximum.');const encoded=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(String(reader.result).split(',')[1]);reader.onerror=reject;reader.readAsDataURL(file)});data=Object.fromEntries(fd);delete data.file;data.file_name=file.name;data.content_type=file.type||'application/octet-stream';data.content_base64=encoded;await api('document-upload',data)}modal.remove();toast('Enregistré.');await refresh();if(newCredential)showCredentials(newCredential.identifier,newCredential.password)}catch(err){toast(err.message)}})}
function showCredentials(identifier,password){const modal=document.createElement('div');modal.className='modal-backdrop';modal.innerHTML=`<section class="modal-card credential-card"><button class="modal-close" aria-label="Fermer">×</button><div class="eyebrow">ACCÈS CRÉÉ</div><h2>Identifiants à transmettre</h2><p>Notez-les et communiquez-les au collaborateur par un canal privé. Le mot de passe ne sera plus affiché après fermeture.</p><label>Identifiant<input readonly value="${esc(identifier)}"></label><label>Mot de passe temporaire<input readonly id="created-password" value="${esc(password)}"></label><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-copy>Copier le mot de passe</button><button type="button" class="primary-small" data-close>Terminer</button></div></section>`;document.body.append(modal);modal.querySelector('.modal-close').onclick=modal.querySelector('[data-close]').onclick=()=>modal.remove();modal.querySelector('[data-copy]').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(password);toast('Mot de passe copié.')}catch{$('#created-password').select();document.execCommand('copy');toast('Mot de passe copié.')}}}
async function load(){try{const [me,dash]=await Promise.all([api('me'),api('dashboard')]);Object.assign(state,{summary:dash.summary||{},employees:dash.employees||[],leaves:dash.leaves||[],organization:dash.organization||state.organization});setUser(me.user)}catch{resetLogin()}}
$('#login-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const button=$('.login-button'),error=$('#login-error');button.disabled=true;error.textContent='';try{const r=await api('login',{identifier:$('#identifier').value.trim(),password:$('#password').value,remember:$('#remember').checked});$('#password').value='';const d=await api('dashboard');Object.assign(state,{summary:d.summary||{},employees:d.employees||[],leaves:d.leaves||[],organization:d.organization||state.organization});setUser(r.user)}catch(err){error.textContent=err.message}finally{button.disabled=false}});
$('#toggle-password').addEventListener('click',()=>$('#password').type=$('#password').type==='password'?'text':'password');$('#logout').addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await api('logout',{})}catch{}resetLogin()});$('#navigation').addEventListener('click',async e=>{const n=e.target.closest('[data-page]');if(!n)return;e.preventDefault();state.page=n.dataset.page;try{await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});$('#page-content').addEventListener('click',async e=>{const nav=e.target.closest('[data-page]');if(nav){e.preventDefault();state.page=nav.dataset.page;try{await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const action=e.target.closest('[data-action]')?.dataset.action;if(action&&action!=='refresh'&&action!=='clock-in'&&action!=='clock-out'&&action!=='break-start'&&action!=='break-end')return openForm(action);try{if(['clock-in','clock-out','break-start','break-end'].includes(action)){await api('attendance-punch',{event:({'clock-in':'in','clock-out':'out','break-start':'break-start','break-end':'break-end'})[action]});toast(action==='clock-in'?'Journée commencée.':'Journée terminée.');await refresh()}const decision=e.target.closest('[data-leave]');if(decision){await api('leave-status',{id:decision.dataset.leave,status:decision.dataset.decision});toast('Décision enregistrée.');await refresh()}const enroll=e.target.closest('[data-enroll]');if(enroll){await api('training-enroll',{training_id:enroll.dataset.enroll});toast('Inscription enregistrée.');await refresh()}const close=e.target.closest('[data-close-job]');if(close){await api('job-close',{id:close.dataset.closeJob});toast('Poste clôturé.');await refresh()}}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});
$('#page-content').addEventListener('change',async e=>{if(e.target.matches('[data-stage]'))try{await api('candidate-stage',{id:e.target.dataset.stage,stage:e.target.value});toast('Étape mise à jour.')}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});$('#page-content').addEventListener('input',e=>{if(!e.target.matches('[data-search],[data-status-filter]'))return;const q=$('[data-search]')?.value.toLowerCase()||'',status=$('[data-status-filter]')?.value||'';document.querySelectorAll('[data-search-row]').forEach(row=>row.hidden=(!row.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q))||(status&&row.dataset.status!==status))});$('#page-content').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{if(e.target.id!=='password-change')return;e.preventDefault();const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));if(d.new_password!==d.confirm_password)return toast('Les deux mots de passe ne correspondent pas.');try{await api('change-password',{current_password:d.current_password,new_password:d.new_password});e.target.reset();state.user.must_change_password=false;state.page='accueil';toast('Mot de passe modifié.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});$('#help-button').addEventListener('click',()=>toast('Pour toute demande, contactez votre équipe RH par vos canaux habituels.'));$('#profile-menu').addEventListener('click',async()=>{state.page='parametres';try{await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});$('.topbar').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin','<button class="mobile-menu" aria-label="Ouvrir le menu">☰</button>');$('.mobile-menu').addEventListener('click',()=>$('.sidebar').classList.toggle('open'));$('.today-chip').innerHTML=`<span class="today-dot"></span>${new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long'}).format(new Date())}`;load();
$('#page-content').addEventListener('click',async e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-edit-employee]');if(!b)return;const emp=state.employees.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.editEmployee);if(!emp)return;const fields=field('first_name','Prénom','text',true,null,`value="${esc(emp.first_name)}"`)+field('last_name','Nom','text',true,null,`value="${esc(emp.last_name)}"`)+field('job_title','Poste','text',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.job_title||'')}"`)+field('department','Service','text',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.department||'')}"`)+field('contract_type','Contrat','text',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.contract_type||'')}"`)+field('start_date','Date d’arrivée','date',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.start_date||'')}"`)+field('location','Lieu','text',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.location||'')}"`)+field('phone_number','Téléphone professionnel','tel',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.phone_number||'')}"`)+field('work_percentage','Taux d’activité (%)','number',false,null,`min="1" max="100" step="0.01" value="${esc(emp.work_percentage??100)}"`)+field('end_date','Date de départ','date',false,null,`value="${esc(emp.end_date||'')}"`)+field('status','Statut','text',true,[['active','Actif'],['onboarding','Arrivée en cours'],['inactive','Inactif']]);const modal=showModal('Modifier le dossier',fields);modal.querySelector('form').addEventListener('submit',async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();try{await api('employee-update',{id:emp.id,...Object.fromEntries(new FormData(ev.target))});modal.remove();toast('Dossier mis à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}})});

function manageAccount(id){const a=state.accounts.find(x=>x.employee_id===id);if(!a)return;const fields=field('role','Rôle','text',true,[['employee','Collaborateur'],['manager','Manager'],['admin','Administration RH']])+`<label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" ${a.enabled?'checked':''}><span>Compte actif</span></label>`+field('temporary_password','Nouveau mot de passe provisoire','password',false,null,'minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password"');const modal=showModal(`Gérer le compte de ${esc(a.first_name)} ${esc(a.last_name)}`,fields);modal.querySelector('[name=role]').value=a.role;modal.querySelector('form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);try{await api('account-update',{employee_id:id,role:f.get('role'),enabled:f.get('enabled')==='on',temporary_password:f.get('temporary_password')||undefined});modal.remove();toast('Compte mis à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}})}
function showTimeCorrection(id){const row=state.attendance.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!row)return;const fields=field('clock_in','Heure d’arrivée souhaitée','datetime-local',true,null,`value="${row.clock_in?new Date(new Date(row.clock_in).getTime()-new Date(row.clock_in).getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,16):''}"`)+field('clock_out','Heure de départ souhaitée','datetime-local',true,null,`value="${row.clock_out?new Date(new Date(row.clock_out).getTime()-new Date(row.clock_out).getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,16):''}"`)+`<label class="span-2">Motif<textarea name="reason" rows="3" minlength="4" required></textarea></label>`;const modal=showModal('Demander une correction de pointage',fields);modal.querySelector('form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));f.clock_in=new Date(f.clock_in).toISOString();f.clock_out=new Date(f.clock_out).toISOString();try{await api('attendance-correction',{attendance_id:id,...f});modal.remove();toast('Demande envoyée pour validation.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}})}
$('#notification-open')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{state.page='taches';try{await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});
$('#page-content').addEventListener('click',async e=>{const period=e.target.closest('[data-period-status]');if(period){try{await api('attendance-period-close',{month:period.dataset.periodMonth,status:period.dataset.periodStatus});toast('Période mise à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const trainingDone=e.target.closest('[data-training-complete]');if(trainingDone){try{await api('training-completion',{id:trainingDone.dataset.trainingComplete,status:'completed'});toast('Participation mise à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const reviewAction=e.target.closest('[data-review-update]');if(reviewAction){try{await api('review-update',{id:reviewAction.dataset.reviewUpdate,status:reviewAction.dataset.status});toast('Entretien mis à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const exp=e.target.closest('[data-export]');if(exp){downloadCsv(exp.dataset.export);return}const manage=e.target.closest('[data-account-edit]');if(manage){manageAccount(manage.dataset.accountEdit);return}const correction=e.target.closest('[data-correct-time]');if(correction){showTimeCorrection(correction.dataset.correctTime);return}const cancel=e.target.closest('[data-cancel-leave]');if(cancel){try{await api('leave-cancel',{id:cancel.dataset.cancelLeave});toast('Demande annulée.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const task=e.target.closest('[data-task-status]');if(task){try{await api('task-update',{id:task.dataset.taskStatus,status:task.dataset.status});toast('Tâche mise à jour.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const note=e.target.closest('[data-notification-read]');if(note){try{await api('notification-read',{id:note.dataset.notificationRead});await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const decision=e.target.closest('[data-time-decision]');if(decision){try{await api('attendance-correction-decision',{id:decision.dataset.timeDecision,status:decision.dataset.decision});toast('Décision enregistrée.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const profile=e.target.closest('[data-profile-decision]');if(profile){try{await api('profile-change-decision',{id:profile.dataset.profileDecision,status:profile.dataset.decision});toast('Décision enregistrée.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const holiday=e.target.closest('[data-holiday-delete]');if(holiday){try{await api('holiday-delete',{id:holiday.dataset.holidayDelete});toast('Jour supprimé.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}}});
$('#page-content').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{const id=e.target.id;if(!['profile-change-form','leave-policy-form','holiday-form','organization-settings-form','retention-settings-form'].includes(id))return;e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);try{if(id==='profile-change-form'){const data=Object.fromEntries(f);if(!data.phone_number&&!data.location)throw Error('Renseignez au moins un champ à corriger.');await api('profile-change',data)}if(id==='leave-policy-form'){await api('leave-policy-save',{leave_type:f.get('leave_type'),annual_allowance:f.get('annual_allowance'),counts_weekends:f.get('counts_weekends')==='on',paid:f.get('paid')==='on',enabled:f.get('enabled')==='on'})}if(id==='holiday-form')await api('holiday-save',Object.fromEntries(f));if(id==='organization-settings-form')await api('settings-save',{key:'organization',name:f.get('name'),locations:String(f.get('locations')||'').split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean)});if(id==='retention-settings-form')await api('settings-save',{key:'retention',document_days:f.get('document_days'),candidate_days:f.get('candidate_days')});e.target.reset();toast('Enregistré.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});

$('#page-content').addEventListener('click',async e=>{const history=e.target.closest('[data-employee-history]');if(history){try{const result=await api('employee-history?id='+encodeURIComponent(history.dataset.employeeHistory));const rows=(result.history||[]).map(x=>`<tr><td>${date(x.effective_at?.slice(0,10))}</td><td>${esc(x.field_name)}</td><td>${esc(x.old_value||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.new_value||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.reason||'—')}</td></tr>`).join('');const modal=showModal('Historique du dossier',table(['DATE D’EFFET','CHAMP','ANCIENNE VALEUR','NOUVELLE VALEUR','MOTIF'],rows||'<tr><td colspan="5">Aucun changement enregistré.</td></tr>'),'Fermer');modal.querySelector('[data-cancel]').onclick=()=>modal.remove();modal.querySelector('.modal-actions .primary-small').type='button';modal.querySelector('.modal-actions .primary-small').onclick=()=>modal.remove();modal.querySelector('.modal-actions .secondary-button').remove()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}const balance=e.target.closest('[data-employee-balance]');if(balance){const emp=state.employees.find(x=>x.id===balance.dataset.employeeBalance);if(!emp)return;const fields=field('delta_days','Variation du solde (+ / −)','number',true,null,'step="0.5"')+field('effective_date','Date d’effet','date',false)+field('note','Motif','text',true);const modal=showModal(`Ajuster le solde de ${esc(emp.first_name)} ${esc(emp.last_name)}`,fields);modal.querySelector('form').addEventListener('submit',async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();const f=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(ev.target));try{await api('leave-balance-adjust',{employee_id:emp.id,...f});modal.remove();toast('Solde ajusté et mouvement journalisé.');await refresh()}catch(err){toast(err.message)}})}});

